flowchart TD
    Start([Start scanner]) --> Args[Parse CLI arguments]
    Args --> LoadRules[Load regex, table-column, and identity rules]
    LoadRules --> FilePrep[Stage 1: file preprocessing]
    FilePrep --> DiscoveryPrep[Stage 2: discovery preprocessing]
    DiscoveryPrep --> Profile[Stage 3: optional profiling/schema plan]
    Profile --> Extract[Stage 4: extract text from each target]
    Extract --> TableText[Canonicalise tables into labelled row text]
    Extract --> Structured[Infer labelled JSON, JSONL, XML, or YAML records]
    Extract --> PlainText[Use extracted plain text]
    TableText --> RegexScan[Run regex rules]
    Structured --> RegexScan
    PlainText --> RegexScan
    RegexScan --> Evidence[Write 4.Regex_Scanning atomic evidence]
    RegexScan --> Linked[Build 4.Regex_Scanning linked evidence]
    Evidence --> Summaries[Build file/entity/regex summaries]
    Linked --> Cluster[Stage 5: clustering]
    Cluster --> Reidentify[Stage 6: reidentification]
    Reidentify --> Report[Stage 7: reporting]
